{"pre_lookup":{"value":"\u003Cul\u003E\r\n\t\u003Cli\u003E\r\n\t\u003Cp\u003EConfirm your registration status.\u0026nbsp;\u003Cem\u003EIf you have not re-registered since 1980, your birth year may not be in our database. \u003C\/em\u003EFor assistance, call or text us at (650) 312-5222 or email us at \u003Ca href=\u0022mailto:registrar@smcacre.gov\u0022\u003Eregistrar@smcacre.gov\u003C\/a\u003E.\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n\t\u003C\/li\u003E\r\n\t\u003Cli\u003E\r\n\t\u003Cp\u003ESign up to \u0022Go Green\u0022 with your Sample Ballot \u0026amp; Official Voter Information Pamphlet and check your \u0022Go Green\u0022 status.\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n\t\u003C\/li\u003E\r\n\t\u003Cli\u003EConfirm your ballot was received during an election. You can also receive ballot tracking information by signing up at\u0026nbsp;\u003Ca href=\u0022http:\/\/wheresmyballot.sos.ca.gov\/\u0022\u003Ewheresmyballot.sos.ca.gov\u003C\/a\u003E.\u003C\/li\u003E\r\n\u003C\/ul\u003E\r\n","format":"basic_html"},"go_green":{"value":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGo Green with Paperless:\u003C\/strong\u003E\u0026nbsp;If you have opted for \u003Cstrong\u003Epaperless electronic sample ballots \u0026amp;\u0026nbsp;official voter information pamphlets\u003C\/strong\u003E, you will not receive a paper voter information pamphlet\u0026nbsp;in the mail before an election.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;You can download the pamphlet on this page when available.\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n\r\n\u003Cp\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n\r\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPaper: \u003C\/strong\u003EIf you have opted\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003Epaper sample ballots \u0026amp;\u0026nbsp;official voter information pamphlets\u003C\/strong\u003E, you will receive a paper voter information pamphlet in the mail before every election.\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n\r\n\u003Cp\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n\r\n\u003Cp\u003ETo change your preference, please enter your California Driver\u0027s License or last 4 digits of your Social Security Number along with an email address and click change preference.\u0026nbsp; For more information on Go Green, click \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/www.smcacre.gov\/elections\/go-green\u0022\u003Ehere.\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\r\n","format":"basic_html"}}